sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Producer
    participant Service
    participant WAL as process-wal
    participant Downstream

    Producer->>Service: Submit work
    Service->>WAL: append(value)
    WAL-->>Service: seq persisted
    Service-->>Producer: Acknowledge

    Service->>Downstream: Perform side effect
    Downstream-->>Service: Success
    Service->>WAL: checkpoint(seq)

    Note over Service,WAL: After restart, replay entries<br/>that were not checkpointed
